        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#two-kinds" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. Two Kinds of Pump</a>
