          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. The Six Picks</a>
          <a href="#gph-vs-lift" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. GPH vs Lift</a>
          <a href="#self-priming" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Self-Priming and Dry Running</a>
